Cognate with {{cog-lite|sco|me}}, {{cog-lite|frr|me}}, {{cog-lite|stq|mie}}, {{cog-lite|nl|me}}, {{m-lite|nl|mij}}, {{cog-lite|nds|mi}}, {{cog-lite|de|mir|pos=dative only}}, {{cog-lite|is|mér|pos=also still dative}}, {{cog|la|mē}}, {{cog-lite|grc|sc=Polyt|μέ|tr=mé}}, {{m-lite|grc|sc=Polyt|ἐμέ||tr=emé}}, {{cog-lite|sa|sc=Deva|मा||tr=mā}}, all meaning “me”.

